<title>THAILAND: Thai M-2 money supply up 10.9 pct yr/yr in Jan.</title>
<headline>Thai M-2 money supply up 10.9 pct yr/yr in Jan.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's M-2 money supply rose 10.9 percent year on year in January against a revised 12.9 percent in December, the Bank of Thailand said on Thursday.</p>
<p>It said the M-2 supply figure fell to an estimated 3.72 trillion baht in January from revised 3.74 trillion in December.</p>
<p>    M-2			 Jan 97     Dec 96	  Jan 96</p>
<p>    Money supply		3.72	 3.74	    3.36</p>
<p>    Percentage change	10.9	 12.9	    18.7</p>
<p>Note - Money supply figures are in trillions of baht. The Bank of Thailand said January figure was an estimate.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662)-2529950-3</p>
</text>
